escription:"Find opportunities for your professional growth—internships, scholarships, and more—in other cities and towns around the world",deportes_y_entrenamientos_name:"Sports and Training",deportes_y_entrenamientos_description:"Find sports opportunities to improve your skills and career in other cities and towns around the world.",el_asesor:"The advisor",la_cura:"The cure",la_formacion:"The training",el_documento:"The documents",el_socio:"The partner",el_cliente:"The client",el_proveedor:"The supplier",la_experiencia:"The experience",el_colaborador:"The collaborator",que_necesitas_a_un_click:" you need is just one click and one flight away. \n Travelgrin makes the connection.",travel_grin_te_conecta:"Travelgrin makes the connection.",por_que_elegir_travelgrin:"Why choose Travelgrin?",facil_simple_y_sin_vueltas:"Easy, simple, and straightforward",buscas_o_publicas:"Search or post in just a few clicks. It's accessible, intuitive, and designed to create real, direct connections.",viajes_que_abren_nuevas_puertas:"Journeys that open new paths",centralizamos_todo_en:"We centralize everything in one place, saving you time, money, and stress on your purposeful, non‑vacation journey.",inteligencia_artificial_y_humana:"Human and AI intelligence combined",combinamos_ia_para:"We use AI to simplify cultural, bureaucratic, and geographic barriers, helping you decide based on your passport country and destination.",un_ecosistema_que_genera_puentes:"An ecosystem that builds bridges",fomentamos_conexiones_seguras:"We foster safe connections and prioritize linking people and organizations with a shared purpose.",historias_como_la_tuya:"Stories just like yours",muchos_ya_se:"Many have already dared to seek advice, learn, or start something in other parts of the world—overcoming doubts and barriers.",existen_puertas_abiertas:"Open doors are waiting for your story.",quiero_comenzar_mi_viaje:"I want to start my journey",se_libre_parte1:"Be free and live",se_libre_parte2:"as a citizen",se_libre_parte3:"of the world",inicia_tu_aventura:"Start your adventure",llega_a_quienes:"Reach exactly those looking for what you offer. Free and powered by intelligence.",en_travelgrin_tu:"On Travelgrin, your proposal is shown to travelers filtered by their country, purpose, and real needs.",cien_propuestas:"+100 proposals are already part of it",publica_gratis_ahora:"Post for free now",como_funciona_publicar_en_travelgrin:"How does posting on Travelgrin work?",publica_tu_propuesta:"Post your proposal",completa_tu_informacion:"Complete your information in minutes. Choose a category, destination, and briefly tell us how you can help.",mostrate_al_publico_indicado:"Present yourself to the right audience.",tu_oferta_llegara:"Your offer will reach travelers filtered by their country of origin and type of search.",hace_match_sin_vueltas:"Make real matches, without complications.",sin_intermediarios_vos:"No middlemen. You offer, they find. Real connections.",sumate_sin_importar:"Join us no matter your size",actuas_de_manera:"Whether you act directly or as an intermediary, if you belong to one of our categories, you are part of Travelgrin.",se_uno_de_los_100:"Be one of the first 100 to \n offer your services and get \n exclusive benefits!",quiero_ser_parte:"I want to be part of it!",somos_travelgrin_transformamos:"We are Travelgrin: transforming the way you travel",no_somos_una:"We’re not a vacation agency. We’re purpose and human connections. At Travelgrin we know what it means to be a foreigner — new cultures, complex paperwork. That’s why we created a platform powered by AI that simplifies decisions based on your country of origin and destination. We support you if you want to train, study, heal, work, start a business, or help in another country. In one place, we connect people, experts, and organizations to make your path easier, building a global ecosystem that transforms realities.",un_viaje_con:"A journey with purpose can also change the world.",en_travelgrin_colaboramos:"At Travelgrin, we collaborate with the UN Sustainable \n Development Goals because we believe travel can \n create a positive impact.",en_travelgrin_colaboramos2:"At Travelgrin, we collaborate with the UN Sustainable Development Goals \n because we believe travel can create a positive impact.",en_travelgrin_colaboramos3:"At Travelgrin, we collaborate with the UN \n Sustainable Development Goals because \n we believe travel can create \n a positive impact.",creemos_en_un:"We believe in a future where the \n world is more personally connected.",cambiar_mi_historia:"Change my story",preguntas_frecuentes:"Frequently Asked Questions",resolvemos:"We resolve your questions about the platform",tengo_que_pagar:"Do I have to pay to look for opportunities or post my service?",no_el_uso:"No. Using the platform is free at this stage. You can search, post, and connect without intermediaries.",que_tipo_de:"What type of services can I post as a provider?",cualquier_servicio_que:"Any service that helps make a purposeful trip possible: from migration advice and document translation to educational consulting, training, business services, and more.",puedo_usar_travelgrin:"Can I use Travelgrin even if I don’t have everything figured out yet?",si_aqui_no:"Yes. Here you don’t need to have your trip fully planned. You can start with a question, an idea, or a specific need. The platform is designed to accompany you from the start.",que_diferencia_a:"What makes Travelgrin different from other platforms?",no_somos_turismo:"We are not a tourism site, nor a typical job board.We are a network for those who want to transform their life (or others’) through meaningful travel, all in one place. We build bridges to make it happen with purpose.",inicio:"Home",categorias:"Categories",sobre_travelgrin:"About Travelgrin",registra_ong:"Register your NGO, business, or profession",como_funciona_publicar:"How does posting on Travelgrin work?",querer_conectar_viajar:"Want + Connect + Travel",sent